# Person portfolio face

One public face, not a Portal action dashboard. DAO tools: `app-dao-face.mdc`. Toasts, stand/endorse errors, mood preview bar: `app-button-toast-contract.mdc`. Open-on-tap: `app-gesture-opens-surface.mdc`. Padding tokens: `app-chrome-spacing.mdc`. Hub hugs vs commerce sheets: `hug-drawer-actions.mdc`. OS-shell mood: `app-ux-contract.mdc`. Dismiss (X + drag handle): `implement-clean.mdc`.

## Identity

Avatar, name, **full** NEAR account id as the handle, full bio. Optional `profile/kind` (`person` | `org` | `dao`) on the same `profile/` object. Omit / person is the default, not required. Unknown renderers ignore it. Omit / person → round avatar, no kind mark. Org → squircle + location line (`BuildingTreeIcon` + “Organization”), and that icon only when `kind` is `org`. Dao → square-ish crest (`1rem`) + quiet “DAO” eyebrow. `kind: 'org'` is not a Sputnik DAO — protocol tools stay heuristic / catalog.

Signals (standing · solidarity · endorsements · reputation) are browse metrics. Hide the row when every count is zero. The compact fallback (`N standing · N posts`) also omits zeros. Face keeps link **icons**. Dock is connect / account / summon. Dock arrows match Stand (`0.55rem`), not the larger face signal clamp.

## Gestures

Quiet text, `·` separators, colored arrows, no border, no pills (not Portal’s bordered cluster; face tags are not pills either). Same height as the standing modal; hover is a soft wash. No disabled CTAs before connect. The Support **form** is the sheet only — not on the face, not in the drawer, and face Support does not open the drawer.

- **Stand** / Standing / Step back — `--signal-standing` — inline toggle (ledger + dots; Step back on hover).
- **Endorse** — `--signal-endorse` — `EndorseComposeSheet` (topic · note · media).
- **Support** — `--signal-reputation` — `ProfileSupportSheet`.
- **Message** — no arrow — `DmComposeSheet`. Person pages only, including logged-out (footer owns Connect).

Disconnected person: full face + **Message**; dock owns Connect. Connected visitor: Stand · Endorse · Support · Message under the bio. Owner: no visitor gestures; unclaimed target balance > 0 shows **gift · amount · Collect** in that slot. DAO states: `app-dao-face.mdc`.

Standing signal → standing overlay. Endorse signal → endorsements list. Face, drawer, or post **Endorse** → compose sheet. Endorsement-row **Support** → spend sheet (`trackTransaction`). Face Support and the drawer Stand · Support whisper → `ProfileSupportSheet` (amount + `trackTransaction`). Stack: amount → presets left / available right → outcome → CTA. Outcome is **live only** from `get_action_config` (never a hardcoded %). A valid amount morphs that line (`0.99 to them · 0.01 protocol boost`). Loading: `Loading split…`. Failure: soft error + Retry. Gated until live and active. Say **protocol boost**, not treasury.

Owner Collect (`PortfolioOwnerSupportCollect`) claims the shared `get_target_balance` pot (profile support, endorsement support, boost-post author share) via `claim_target_balance` + `trackTransaction`. Owner-only. Hide at zero. Not in the account sheet.

## Gesture sheets

`OsGestureSheet` + `GestureSheetHeader` over the face (host-mood peek) — not a post-compose slide-over. Family: Support, Endorse, scarce buy/sell, protocol tasks. Do not hand-roll `GlassSheet` + `GestureSheetHeader`. Host mood is the page owner (`mood` or `usePageOwnerMood`); hues via `supportSheetPanelStyle` → `panelStyle`. Mood fields use `os-field-bordered` (wash shows through). `os-field-soft` is for quiet non-mood OS sheets only. One title beat, not a second face card and not avatar · name · handle plus a bare verb: signal-colored verb + person (`Support Voter 02`), then quiet `@` + **full** id (never strip `.near` / `.testnet`; `fallbackLabel` / raw `accountId`). Whisper only when relationship state exists. Close is top-right.

Shared fields, do not hand-roll: `AmountField` / `SuffixField`, `AmountFieldMetaRow` (presets / Max / balance), `OsAccountField` (`NearAccountField` sanitizes + probes), `CollectionQtyStepper`, `TokenIcon`.

Inset is UI `.os-gesture-sheet-body` (1.15rem + safe-area). `profile-support-sheet-body` is keyboard/footer only — pass it on new sheets; do not add a second pad. Form gap `0.85rem`. List overlays match `.standing-panel` (`gap: 0.65rem`, `padding: 0.35rem … 1.25rem`) for Standing, Endorsements, DAO Members / Treasury. Rows: `.standing-row` + `StandingIdentity`. Asides `flex-end`.

## Page drawer

Covers the face. Not a second portfolio or a chapter list. Mood-thread chrome + a thin grip. No gesture footer. No avatar, `@id`, bio, or bio bridge. No reputation band names (score/rank stay on the face). Tags are quiet text here only. Hide zero counts.

Header: **name** + **Joined Mon YYYY ›**. **Joined** opens a slim facts sheet, not a second face card. OnSocial: Joined · fused `Updated Mar 12 · Name · Banner` (omit when the same day as Joined) · activity/roles/tags when present. NEAR: Network · Account · Created. Posts, guilds, and scarces stay in the rail tabs and in that sheet. DAO roles / tags live in that sheet.

Rail under the facts: Posts · Replies · Reposts · Media, plus Scarces and Collectibles only when the account has them. Open tab is the body (`?tab=`). One scroller. Collectibles peeks holdings. **See all** is `/@account/collectibles` for owner and visitor. Connected `/collectibles` soft-redirects to `/@you/collectibles`.

## Mood

One stack for this face and “this person’s page / this viewer’s wallet.” No second system. No per-control color hacks.

Face, wash, drawer: **page** `effectiveMood` on `portfolio-os-layer`. Summon dock / grip / pill: **viewer** (`useViewerDockMood` via `AppShellLauncher`), including a visit — do not paint `portfolio-os-layer` with viewer mood; finish CSS targets `.portfolio-summon-dock[data-mood=…]` only. **Owner** dock uses live `effectiveMood` so preview paints it. Wallet sheets: **viewer** `useViewerWalletMoodVars`, seeded with the protocol fallback (no blue-corner flash). Guild / hub / collection / drop: **viewer** when logged in, none logged out — never the page owner’s mood. Host mood stays on the face, the drawer, and face gesture sheets.

`@/lib/moods/resolve` (`resolvePortfolioMood`, `resolvePortfolioMoodForPreview`, `portfolioMoodShellStyle`). Live face: `PortfolioShellRoot` + `PortfolioMoodPreviewProvider`. Page-owner sheets use those hooks, not a hard-coded accent.

Washes match on picker cards, the live shell, home, and create-post: `--mood-bg-preset-mix` 25% dark / 30% light (light is higher so subtler presets still read); text and muted mixes 18% / 18%. Title takes the accent (Gold keeps foil); tagline stays muted. Row type stays compact — not the face name scale or ornaments.

`--mood-ink` (`--mood-accent-chrome`) is chrome only, not verbs or selected chips. Ink remap (viewer on OS screens, host on the face): row hover `--os-surface-row-hover` / `--os-surface-fill-hover`.

Mood-blended (Protocol mood = originals). Reply hover `--signal-standing`. `--signal-reputation`: quote hover / quoted; Support arrow; `#` `@` `$` links and Show more; Discover browse + trending; List / Buy / Sell / Bid / Mint (feed verbs and those sheets; portaled sheets pass `moodId` + portal signal style; remap is on `[data-mood]`); selected chips / amount presets (`--os-chip-selected-*`: wallet, Support SOCIAL, Buy/List NEAR, Boost, create-drop, calendar, access); received Support totals. Endorse + compose chips: `--signal-endorse`.

Protocol, not mood: Like `--protocol-red`; Boost / amplify `--protocol-amber`; Love, player progress, Save, copied, chip `is-ready` / `is-succeeded` `--protocol-green`. Portfolio desktop is a hairline — no `0 0 20px` halo.

Preview while browsing. On chain success `commitMoodPreview(moodId)` — do not `discardMoodPreview()` or clear before props catch up (stale SSR snap-back). Then `seedViewerCommittedMood` + wallet `setMood` + `router.refresh()`. Prefer RSC `mood` / `config`; chain soft-fill only when SSR config was empty. No hard refresh. Preview bar: `app-button-toast-contract.mdc`.
